{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 15,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 328.986,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then will I sing to my well-beloved a song of my beloved,",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.267,
      "end": 5.753,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "touching his vineyard.",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.933,
      "end": 9.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "My well-beloved hath a vineyard in a very fruitful hill.",
      "verse": "15:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.235,
      "end": 11.721,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he fenced it,",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.901,
      "end": 14.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and gathered out the stones thereof,",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 14.449,
      "end": 16.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and planted it with the choicest vine,",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 17.09,
      "end": 19.551,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and built a tower in the midst of it,",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 19.731,
      "end": 22.239,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also made a wine-press therein;",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 22.419,
      "end": 25.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he looked that it should bring forth grapes,",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 26.175,
      "end": 28.636,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it brought forth wild grapes.",
      "verse": "15:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 29.316,
      "end": 30.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 30.378,
      "end": 33.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O inhabitants of Jerusalem and men of Judah,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 33.716,
      "end": 35.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "judge, I pray you,",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 35.289,
      "end": 37.147,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "betwixt me and my vineyard.",
      "verse": "15:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 37.827,
      "end": 40.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What could have been done more to my vineyard",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 40.608,
      "end": 42.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I have not done in it?",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 42.413,
      "end": 45.71,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, when I looked that it should bring forth grapes",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 45.89,
      "end": 47.98,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it brought forth wild grapes.",
      "verse": "15:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 48.66,
      "end": 50.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now go to;",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 50.187,
      "end": 52.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will tell you what I will do to my vineyard\u2014",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 52.968,
      "end": 55.429,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will take away the hedge thereof,",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 55.609,
      "end": 57.374,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shall be eaten up;",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 57.554,
      "end": 60.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will break down the wall thereof,",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 60.242,
      "end": 62.053,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shall be trodden down;",
      "verse": "15:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 62.733,
      "end": 64.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will lay it waste;",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 64.678,
      "end": 66.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it shall not be pruned nor digged;",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 67.087,
      "end": 69.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but there shall come up briers and thorns;",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 69.914,
      "end": 73.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will also command the clouds that they rain no rain upon it.",
      "verse": "15:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 74.402,
      "end": 78.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the vineyard of the Lord of Hosts is the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 78.669,
      "end": 81.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the men of Judah his pleasant plant;",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 81.45,
      "end": 84.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he looked for judgment, and behold, oppression;",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 84.788,
      "end": 87.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for righteousness, but behold, a cry.",
      "verse": "15:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 87.976,
      "end": 90.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo unto them that join house to house,",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 90.664,
      "end": 92.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "till there can be no place,",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 92.794,
      "end": 96.231,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may be placed alone in the midst of the earth!",
      "verse": "15:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 96.911,
      "end": 99.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "In mine ears, said the Lord of Hosts,",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 99.459,
      "end": 102.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of a truth many houses shall be desolate,",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 102.658,
      "end": 105.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and great and fair cities without inhabitant.",
      "verse": "15:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 106.449,
      "end": 109.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, ten acres of vineyard shall yield one bath,",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 110.112,
      "end": 113.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the seed of a homer shall yield an ephah.",
      "verse": "15:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 114.089,
      "end": 116.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo unto them that rise up early in the morning,",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 116.963,
      "end": 119.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may follow strong drink,",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 119.511,
      "end": 122.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that continue until night, and wine inflame them!",
      "verse": "15:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 123.628,
      "end": 125.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the harp, and the viol,",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 126.037,
      "end": 129.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the tabret, and pipe, and wine are in their feasts;",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 129.7,
      "end": 132.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they regard not the work of the Lord,",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 132.713,
      "end": 135.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither consider the operation of his hands.",
      "verse": "15:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 135.947,
      "end": 138.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, my people are gone into captivity,",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 139.146,
      "end": 141.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they have no knowledge;",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 141.184,
      "end": 143.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their honorable men are famished,",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 143.593,
      "end": 146.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their multitude dried up with thirst.",
      "verse": "15:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 146.734,
      "end": 149.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, hell hath enlarged herself,",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 149.468,
      "end": 151.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and opened her mouth without measure;",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 152.063,
      "end": 153.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their glory,",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 153.543,
      "end": 156.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their multitude, and their pomp,",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 156.184,
      "end": 157.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he that rejoiceth,",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 158.082,
      "end": 159.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall descend into it.",
      "verse": "15:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 160.434,
      "end": 162.895,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the mean man shall be brought down,",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 163.075,
      "end": 165.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the mighty man shall be humbled,",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 165.531,
      "end": 168.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the eyes of the lofty shall be humbled.",
      "verse": "15:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 168.719,
      "end": 171.97,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the Lord of Hosts shall be exalted in judgment,",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 172.15,
      "end": 175.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and God that is holy shall be sanctified in righteousness.",
      "verse": "15:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 176.499,
      "end": 179.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Then shall the lambs feed after their manner,",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 179.512,
      "end": 183.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the waste places of the fat ones shall strangers eat.",
      "verse": "15:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 183.721,
      "end": 186.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo unto them that draw iniquity with cords of vanity,",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 186.966,
      "end": 189.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sin as it were with a cart rope;",
      "verse": "15:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 190.154,
      "end": 192.476,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "That say: Let him make speed,",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 192.656,
      "end": 194.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hasten his work,",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 194.415,
      "end": 195.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we may see it;",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 196.128,
      "end": 200.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and let the counsel of the Holy One of Israel draw nigh and come,",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 200.395,
      "end": 201.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we may know it.",
      "verse": "15:19",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 202.654,
      "end": 205.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo unto them that call evil good,",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 205.295,
      "end": 206.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and good evil,",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 206.682,
      "end": 208.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that put darkness for light,",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 208.812,
      "end": 210.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and light for darkness,",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 210.664,
      "end": 212.707,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that put bitter for sweet,",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 212.887,
      "end": 214.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sweet for bitter!",
      "verse": "15:20",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 215.053,
      "end": 217.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo unto the wise in their own eyes",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 217.555,
      "end": 219.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prudent in their own sight!",
      "verse": "15:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 220.418,
      "end": 222.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo unto the mighty to drink wine,",
      "verse": "15:22",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 222.734,
      "end": 225.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and men of strength to mingle strong drink;",
      "verse": "15:22",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 226.154,
      "end": 228.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Who justify the wicked for reward,",
      "verse": "15:23",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 228.842,
      "end": 231.721,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and take away the righteousness of the righteous from him!",
      "verse": "15:23",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 232.401,
      "end": 235.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, as the fire devoureth the stubble,",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 235.367,
      "end": 237.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the flame consumeth the chaff,",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 237.683,
      "end": 239.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their root shall be rottenness,",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 240.046,
      "end": 242.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their blossoms shall go up as dust;",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 242.455,
      "end": 245.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because they have cast away the law of the Lord of Hosts,",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 245.979,
      "end": 249.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and despised the word of the Holy One of Israel.",
      "verse": "15:24",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 249.956,
      "end": 254.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, is the anger of the Lord kindled against his people,",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 254.223,
      "end": 257.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he hath stretched forth his hand against them,",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 257.561,
      "end": 259.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hath smitten them;",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 259.459,
      "end": 261.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the hills did tremble,",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 261.45,
      "end": 264.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their carcasses were torn in the midst of the streets.",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 264.927,
      "end": 267.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For all this his anger is not turned away,",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 267.522,
      "end": 269.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but his hand is stretched out still.",
      "verse": "15:25",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 270.57,
      "end": 273.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he will lift up a ensign to the nations from far,",
      "verse": "15:26",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 274.001,
      "end": 277.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and will hiss unto them from the end of the earth;",
      "verse": "15:26",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 277.339,
      "end": 280.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, they shall come with speed swiftly;",
      "verse": "15:26",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 280.445,
      "end": 283.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "none shall be weary nor stumble among them.",
      "verse": "15:26",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 283.819,
      "end": 285.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "None shall slumber nor sleep;",
      "verse": "15:27",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 286.089,
      "end": 289.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall the girdle of their loins be loosed,",
      "verse": "15:27",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 289.241,
      "end": 291.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor the latchet of their shoes be broken;",
      "verse": "15:27",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 292.615,
      "end": 294.937,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Whose arrows shall be sharp,",
      "verse": "15:28",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 295.117,
      "end": 296.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all their bows bent,",
      "verse": "15:28",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 297.108,
      "end": 300.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their horses' hoofs shall be counted like flint,",
      "verse": "15:28",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 300.585,
      "end": 302.721,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their wheels like a whirlwind,",
      "verse": "15:28",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 302.901,
      "end": 304.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their roaring like a lion.",
      "verse": "15:28",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 305.439,
      "end": 307.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They shall roar like young lions;",
      "verse": "15:29",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 307.848,
      "end": 310.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they shall roar, and lay hold of the prey,",
      "verse": "15:29",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 310.907,
      "end": 312.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall carry away safe,",
      "verse": "15:29",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 313.084,
      "end": 314.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and none shall deliver.",
      "verse": "15:29",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 315.436,
      "end": 318.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in that day they shall roar against them",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 318.402,
      "end": 320.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "like the roaring of the sea;",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 320.532,
      "end": 322.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if they look unto the land,",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 322.802,
      "end": 324.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, darkness and sorrow,",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 324.979,
      "end": 328.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the light is darkened in the heavens thereof.",
      "verse": "15:30",
      "lineIndex": 122
    }
  ]
}